        "subject": "LU-20411 ofd: fix lastid_rwsem leak in ofd_echo_create",
        "message": "LU-20411 ofd: fix lastid_rwsem leak in ofd_echo_create\n\nThe ofd_validate_seq() failure path returned without releasing\nofd_lastid_rwsem, which was taken a few lines above.\n\nFound by CONFIG_WARN_CONTEXT_ANALYSIS.\n\nFixes: c336959222 (\"LU-8667 osp: validate FID before initializing precreate seq\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I6ee32ce9aee46f5b346edec03f950c156a6a6964\n"
